        "hint": "Use dataType + data + id to replace block content. Returns a slim success object instead of raw DOM operations. block(action="update") is best for single-block replacement; multi-line markdown may be truncated to the first line by SiYuan, so use append/prepend/insert when you need multiple blocks or tables. If the content should create tags, write them as #tag#.",
