    "description": "📝 Grouped document operations. Use the "action" field to select the operation.

Common actions: create, rename, get_path, get_hpath, get_ids, get_child_blocks, get_child_docs, search_docs, get_doc. Required fields: create: notebook, path; rename: notebook, path, title; get_path: id; get_hpath: no additional fields; get_ids: notebook, path; get_child_blocks: id; get_child_docs: id; search_docs: notebook, query; get_doc: id.

Additional actions: remove, move, set_icon, set_cover, list_tree, create_daily_note, duplicate, remove_batch, create_empty, heading_to_doc, doc_to_heading. Read siyuan://help/action/document/{action} for details, or call action="help" if resources are unavailable.

Parameter contract per action (fields outside the action's optional list should not be sent):
document.create: required [notebook, path] | optional [markdown, icon]
document.rename: required [notebook, path, title] | optional []
document.remove: required [notebook, path] | optional []
document.move: required [notebook, path] | optional [toNotebook, toPath, fromIDs, fromPaths, toID]
document.get_path: required [id] | optional []
document.get_hpath: required [] | optional [id, notebook, path]
document.get_ids: required [notebook, path] | optional []
document.get_child_blocks: required [id] | optional []
document.get_child_docs: required [id] | optional []
document.set_icon: required [id, icon] | optional []
document.set_cover: required [id] | optional [source]
document.list_tree: required [notebook] | optional [path, maxDepth]
document.search_docs: required [notebook, query] | optional []
document.get_doc: required [id] | optional [mode, size, page, pageSize]
document.create_daily_note: required [notebook] | optional []
document.duplicate: required [id] | optional []
document.remove_batch: required [paths] | optional []
document.create_empty: required [notebook, path] | optional []
document.heading_to_doc: required [headingID] | optional []
document.doc_to_heading: required [srcID, targetID] | optional [after]

document(action="create") uses a human-readable target path such as /Inbox/Weekly Note. Other document actions that use notebook + path expect storage paths returned by document(action="get_path"). Requires user confirmation before: remove, move, remove_batch.",
    "overview": {
      "actionSummaries": {
        "create": "Use notebook + path + markdown, where path is human-readable.",
        "create_daily_note": "Use a notebook ID and optionally pass app for downstream SiYuan event routing. When the user asks for a diary, journal entry, daily log, or today’s note in a notebook, prefer this action over manually creating a path and then appending content.",
        "create_empty": "requires: notebook, path",
        "doc_to_heading": "requires: srcID, targetID",
        "duplicate": "requires: id",
        "get_child_blocks": "Use a document ID. Returns direct child blocks only.",
        "get_child_docs": "Use a document ID. Returns direct child documents only.",
        "get_doc": "Use a document ID. mode="markdown" returns clean Markdown content and supports page/pageSize for long documents; mode="html" uses the current focus view. For structured reading, prefer get_child_blocks.",
        "get_hpath": "Use either id or notebook + path. Right after create, a short retry may still be needed while SiYuan indexing catches up.",
        "get_ids": "Use notebook + path, where path is human-readable (same format as action="create"). This is the recommended way to resolve document IDs from paths. Right after create, a short retry may be needed while SiYuan indexing catches up.",
