        "hint": "Use assetsDirPath + localFilePath to read a local file and upload it into SiYuan assets. This action reads the local filesystem and requires explicit user confirmation. Files larger than the configured large-upload threshold (10 MB by default) must be stopped, confirmed by the user, and retried with confirmLargeFile=true.",
        "requiredFields": [
