        "shapes": [
          "assetsDirPath + localFilePath",
        ],
        "tool": "file",
      },
    },
    "description": "📁 Grouped file and asset operations. Use the "action" field to select the operation.

Common actions: upload_asset, export_md, get_doc_assets. Required fields: upload_asset: assetsDirPath, localFilePath; export_md: id; get_doc_assets: id.

Additional actions: render_template, render_sprig, export_resources, list_unused_assets, get_image_ocr_text, remove_unused_assets, rename_asset, delete_asset, set_image_alpha. Read siyuan://help/action/file/{action} for details, or call action="help" if resources are unavailable.

Parameter contract per action (fields outside the action's optional list should not be sent):
file.upload_asset: required [assetsDirPath, localFilePath] | optional [confirmLargeFile]
file.render_template: required [id, path] | optional []
file.render_sprig: required [template] | optional []
file.export_md: required [id] | optional []
file.export_resources: required [paths] | optional [name, outputPath]
file.list_unused_assets: required [] | optional []
file.get_doc_assets: required [id] | optional [assetType]
file.get_image_ocr_text: required [] | optional [path]
file.remove_unused_assets: required [] | optional []
file.rename_asset: required [oldPath, newName] | optional []
file.delete_asset: required [path] | optional []
file.set_image_alpha: required [path, alpha] | optional []

file(action="upload_asset") reads a local file path and uploads that file into SiYuan assets. Because it reads the local filesystem, it requires explicit user confirmation before execution. If the file is larger than the configured large-upload threshold (10 MB by default), MCP must stop and ask the user for explicit confirmation before retrying with confirmLargeFile=true. Requires user confirmation before: upload_asset, remove_unused_assets, delete_asset.",
    "overview": {
      "actionSummaries": {
        "delete_asset": "requires: path",
        "export_md": "requires: id",
        "export_resources": "Provide one or more existing resource paths. Asset paths like assets/foo.txt are normalized to /data/assets/foo.txt before export. Set outputPath to also copy the exported ZIP to a local filesystem path. Using outputPath is high-risk and requires explicit user confirmation.",
        "get_doc_assets": "Use a document ID to list assets referenced by the document after read-permission checks. Use assetType="image" to return only image assets.",
        "get_image_ocr_text": "Use an asset path to read stored OCR text. If path is omitted, SiYuan returns an empty text payload.",
        "list_unused_assets": "no extra fields",
        "remove_unused_assets": "no extra fields",
        "rename_asset": "requires: oldPath, newName",
        "render_sprig": "requires: template",
        "render_template": "Use id + path, where path points to a template file inside the SiYuan workspace. Local filesystem paths outside the workspace are rejected by the kernel.",
        "set_image_alpha": "requires: path, alpha",
        "upload_asset": "Use assetsDirPath + localFilePath to read a local file and upload it into SiYuan assets. This action reads the local filesystem and requires explicit user confirmation. Files larger than the configured large-upload threshold (10 MB by default) must be stopped, confirmed by the user, and retried with confirmLargeFile=true.",
      },
      "actions": {
        "delete_asset": {
          "requiresConfirmation": true,
        },
        "export_md": {
          "requiresConfirmation": false,
        },
        "export_resources": {
          "hint": "Provide one or more existing resource paths. Asset paths like assets/foo.txt are normalized to /data/assets/foo.txt before export. Set outputPath to also copy the exported ZIP to a local filesystem path. Using outputPath is high-risk and requires explicit user confirmation.",
          "requiresConfirmation": false,
        },
        "get_doc_assets": {
          "hint": "Use a document ID to list assets referenced by the document after read-permission checks. Use assetType="image" to return only image assets.",
          "requiresConfirmation": false,
        },
        "get_image_ocr_text": {
          "hint": "Use an asset path to read stored OCR text. If path is omitted, SiYuan returns an empty text payload.",
          "requiresConfirmation": false,
        },
        "list_unused_assets": {
          "requiresConfirmation": false,
        },
        "remove_unused_assets": {
          "requiresConfirmation": true,
        },
        "rename_asset": {
          "requiresConfirmation": false,
        },
        "render_sprig": {
          "requiresConfirmation": false,
        },
        "render_template": {
          "hint": "Use id + path, where path points to a template file inside the SiYuan workspace. Local filesystem paths outside the workspace are rejected by the kernel.",
          "requiresConfirmation": false,
        },
        "set_image_alpha": {
          "requiresConfirmation": false,
        },
        "upload_asset": {
          "hint": "Use assetsDirPath + localFilePath to read a local file and upload it into SiYuan assets. This action reads the local filesystem and requires explicit user confirmation. Files larger than the configured large-upload threshold (10 MB by default) must be stopped, confirmed by the user, and retried with confirmLargeFile=true.",
          "requiresConfirmation": true,
        },
      },
      "advancedActions": [
        "render_template",
        "render_sprig",
        "export_resources",
        "list_unused_assets",
        "get_image_ocr_text",
        "remove_unused_assets",
        "rename_asset",
        "delete_asset",
        "set_image_alpha",
      ],
      "commonActions": [
        "upload_asset",
        "export_md",
        "get_doc_assets",
      ],
      "detailsHint": "Call file(action="help", topic="<actionName>") for required fields, shapes, and a minimal example.",
      "guidance": [
        "file(action="upload_asset") reads a local file path and uploads that file into SiYuan assets. Because it reads the local filesystem, it requires explicit user confirmation before execution.",
        "If the file is larger than the configured large-upload threshold (10 MB by default), MCP must stop and ask the user for explicit confirmation before retrying with confirmLargeFile=true.",
        "file(action="export_resources") exports the given paths as a ZIP archive, normalizes common asset path formats, and can optionally save the ZIP to a local filesystem path.",
        "file(action="export_resources", outputPath=...) writes to the local filesystem and requires explicit user confirmation before execution.",
        "file(action="render_template") requires a template path inside the SiYuan workspace; arbitrary local paths like /tmp/... are rejected by the kernel.",
      ],
