    "description": "🃏 Grouped flashcard review and deck operations. Use the "action" field to select the operation.

Common actions: list_cards, get_decks, get_cards. Required fields: list_cards: scope, filter; get_decks: no additional fields; get_cards: deckID.

Additional actions: review_card, skip_review_card, create_card, add_card, remove_card. Read siyuan://help/action/flashcard/{action} for details, or call action="help" if resources are unavailable.

Parameter contract per action (fields outside the action's optional list should not be sent):
flashcard.list_cards: required [scope, filter] | optional [deckID, notebook, rootID]
flashcard.get_decks: required [] | optional []
flashcard.get_cards: required [deckID] | optional [page, pageSize]
flashcard.review_card: required [deckID, cardID, rating] | optional [reviewedCards]
flashcard.skip_review_card: required [deckID, cardID] | optional []
flashcard.create_card: required [deckID, blockIDs] | optional []
flashcard.add_card: required [deckID, blockIDs] | optional []
flashcard.remove_card: required [deckID, blockIDs] | optional []

flashcard actions cover review-first flashcard workflows and deck discovery. list_cards always reads from the kernel due-card endpoints and MCP post-filters cards by state for filter="new" or filter="old". Requires user confirmation before: remove_card.",
