    "description": "🖥️ Grouped system and notification operations. Use the "action" field to select the operation.

Common actions: conf, boot_progress, get_version, get_current_time. Required fields: conf: no additional fields; boot_progress: no additional fields; get_version: no additional fields; get_current_time: no additional fields.

Additional actions: workspace_info, network, changelog, sys_fonts, push_msg, push_err_msg. Read siyuan://help/action/system/{action} for details, or call action="help" if resources are unavailable.

Parameter contract per action (fields outside the action's optional list should not be sent):
system.workspace_info: required [] | optional []
system.network: required [] | optional []
system.changelog: required [] | optional []
system.conf: required [] | optional [mode, keyPath, maxDepth, maxItems]
system.sys_fonts: required [] | optional [mode, offset, limit, query]
system.boot_progress: required [] | optional []
system.push_msg: required [msg] | optional [timeout]
system.push_err_msg: required [msg] | optional [timeout]
system.get_version: required [] | optional []
system.get_current_time: required [] | optional []

All system actions in this tool are read-only. system(action="workspace_info") exposes the workspace path and is high-risk; it is disabled by default. Requires user confirmation before: workspace_info.",
